WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:17.333
"Hi, Miss Shelly.

2
00:00:17.334 --> 00:00:20.031
What are we doing today?"

3
00:00:20.032 --> 00:00:24.274
Jason was the first to arrive in the gym for Kids Central.

4
00:00:24.275 --> 00:00:29.577
"Hello, Jason. I can't tell you until everyone else arrives.

5
00:00:29.578 --> 00:00:37.536
But you can help me pass out these index cards," Miss Shelly said.

6
00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:42.408
"Hi." Nina walked in next.

7
00:00:42.409 --> 00:00:46.042
"What are the cards for?"

8
00:00:46.043 --> 00:00:51.653
"We can't find out until everyone gets here," Jason told her.

9
00:00:51.654 --> 00:00:55.469
Bobby and Izzie walked in.

10
00:00:55.470 --> 00:00:59.094
"Let's start!" Jason told Miss Shelly.

11
00:00:59.095 --> 00:01:01.822
"Everyone is here."

12
00:01:01.823 --> 00:01:06.384
"Jason, let me sit down first. Geesh!"

13
00:01:06.385 --> 00:01:10.950
Izzie rolled her eyes at Nina and sat down at the table.

14
00:01:10.951 --> 00:01:14.759
"Okay, now I'm ready."

15
00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:20.515
"Today we will do something impossible," Miss Shelly said.

16
00:01:20.516 --> 00:01:31.092
"No way. That's impossible!" Bobby said. Everyone laughed.

17
00:01:31.093 --> 00:01:33.745
"Hold up your index card.

18
00:01:33.746 --> 00:01:39.777
Which is bigger, the card or your face?" Miss Shelly asked.

19
00:01:39.778 --> 00:01:44.275
"My face," Izzie and Nina said at the same time.

20
00:01:44.276 --> 00:01:47.963
"Of course my face," Bobby said.

21
00:01:47.964 --> 00:01:50.004
But Jason shook his head.

22
00:01:50.005 --> 00:01:52.879
He had seen magic shows before.

23
00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:56.563
"Is this a trick question?" he asked.

24
00:01:56.564 --> 00:01:59.395
"I think the card is bigger."

25
00:01:59.396 --> 00:02:02.511
"You think the card is bigger?

26
00:02:02.512 --> 00:02:06.187
Let's measure and see," Miss Shelly said.

27
00:02:06.188 --> 00:02:08.647
"How big is the card?"

28
00:02:08.648 --> 00:02:15.277
Bobby measured. "13 centimeters wide and 8 centimeters tall."

29
00:02:15.278 --> 00:02:22.549
"Have you ever measured your face?" Miss Shelly asked.

30
00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:29.315
"My face is 17 centimeters long and 12 centimeters wide," Jason said.

31
00:02:29.316 --> 00:02:32.691
"So your head is bigger.

32
00:02:32.692 --> 00:02:38.211
But I bet you can fit your head through this little index card."

33
00:02:38.212 --> 00:02:41.402
Miss Shelly held up her card.

34
00:02:41.403 --> 00:02:45.521
"What? No way!" Jason said.

35
00:02:45.522 --> 00:02:49.033
"Impossible," Bobby said.

36
00:02:49.034 --> 00:02:52.961
"I bet Miss Shelly can do it," Izzie said.

37
00:02:52.962 --> 00:02:56.347
She smiled at her favorite teacher.

38
00:02:56.348 --> 00:03:01.406
"Well, I'll show you a trick," Miss Shelly said.

39
00:03:01.407 --> 00:03:04.944
"A magic trick?" Jason asked.

40
00:03:04.945 --> 00:03:07.012
"Not a magic trick.

41
00:03:07.013 --> 00:03:12.400
A real trick," she answered.

42
00:03:12.401 --> 00:03:19.352
"Step 1: Fold your card in half from top to bottom.

43
00:03:19.353 --> 00:03:26.348
Step 2: Make 13 small cuts on the folded side of your card."

44
00:03:26.349 --> 00:03:29.085
Everyone cut carefully.

45
00:03:29.086 --> 00:03:36.710
"Step 3: Make 13 small cuts on the open side of your card.

46
00:03:36.711 --> 00:03:42.912
Step 4: Carefully unfold your card and cut along the fold.

47
00:03:42.913 --> 00:03:48.215
But do not cut the first edge or the last edge.

48
00:03:48.216 --> 00:03:50.131
What do you have?"

49
00:03:50.132 --> 00:03:52.562
Jason unfolded his card.

50
00:03:52.563 --> 00:03:55.406
His eyes opened wide.

51
00:03:55.407 --> 00:03:58.163
"Wow! It's huge.

52
00:03:58.164 --> 00:04:01.892
And my head fits through it!"

53
00:04:01.893 --> 00:04:05.803
"But it's still just a regular index card."

54
00:04:05.804 --> 00:04:09.477
Miss Shelly put her card back together.

55
00:04:09.478 --> 00:04:13.523
"That's a cool trick, Miss Shelly," Jason said.

56
00:04:13.524 --> 00:04:17.699
"Will you teach us more like that?"

57
00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:21.907
"Sure. But right now I think your dad's waiting for you."

58
00:04:21.908 --> 00:04:25.009
She pointed to the door.

59
00:04:25.010 --> 00:04:29.491
"Dad!" Jason jumped up.

60
00:04:29.492 --> 00:04:31.673
"Want to see a cool trick?

61
00:04:31.674 --> 00:04:39.262
I can put my head through an index card!"

62
00:04:39.263 --> 00:04:49.986
[caption_out@
